        416,
        1827,
        657
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As to City employees paid on a weekly or annual basis, the terms of the statute clearly require that they receive leave of absence with full pay on Memorial Day and Armistice Day.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
